    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d2a64fefe1a6c0142b2f2a0b",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我一边跟第一红宝石检讨比赛，\n一边回想今天的表现──\n尤其是当时的“速度”。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a74b5e4b5064f65608d50f83300e7f0cf34cd342f4ccdbf5e14b28dc862f5223",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        12,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/12/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:70e5335021f58cbf638d7542",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "仿佛一闪而过的优异速度……\n应可谓之与生俱来的才华吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "95555ec6bafb4a1793ca71c2d964ad0e6b50b2345cfe74cfd4f4a97663f04199",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085304.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        13,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/13/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c9f1c2a3236091bb617cd630",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "（如果她能在最快的舞台上冲刺──）",
      "source_fingerprint": "8847d77fcfed8518c5a296d8a684aead34586680258052dc119207a42c39f0b5",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/50/1085/storytimeline_501085304.json",
